wayland/layershell: add WlrLayershell.cursorShape

The cursor over a layer window where none of its items sets one. It is set
on the window before the window is shown, so it applies from the pointer's
first enter. Omarchy's startup cover sets Qt.BlankCursor, so that no cursor
shows over it while Hyprland starts.

Not yet upstream.

diff -ruN qs-omarchy/src/wayland/wlr_layershell/wlr_layershell.cpp qs-cursor/src/wayland/wlr_layershell/wlr_layershell.cpp
